starfix demo                                                                live
Keys
  j, k, arrows      move
  PgUp, PgDn, g, G  a page, the top, the bottom
  enter, right      open the issue
  esc, left         back
  r                 read everything again
  ?                 this help
  q, ctrl-c         quit

Marks
  [overlaps ID]   its files overlap those of ID, which another session holds
  [by ID +N]      the open issues it waits for
  [lapsed]        the lease ran out; the reaper frees it soon

The board is read-only. It updates as the server pushes changes.

? or esc back  q quit
